            %li
              %p
                the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steenrod-Wockel+approximation+theorem"} Steenrod-Wockel approximation theorem
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+Serre-Swan+theorem"} smooth Serre-Swan theorem
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivations+of+smooth+functions+are+vector+fields"} derivations of smooth functions are vector fields
          %p
            The analogous statement in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topology"} topology
            is:
